---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About · Rohit Nair">
	<section class="px-6 py-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
		<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
			<div class="size-16 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-teal-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-semibold">
				RN
			</div>
			<div>
				<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">Rohit Nair</h1>
				<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Director, Scope Ratings</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
			<p>
				I've spent over a decade assessing corporate credit risk for companies across Europe,
				covering telecoms, oil & gas, and metals & mining. I currently work as a Director at
				Scope Ratings.
			</p>
			<p>
				More recently, I've been teaching myself AI — working through how the tools actually
				work and where they're genuinely useful, rather than treating it as a buzzword. This
				site is where I write about both sides of that: credit risk analysis, and what I'm
				learning about AI along the way.
			</p>
			<p>
				Have a look at the <a href="/articles" class="text-teal-700 underline underline-offset-2">Articles</a>
				and <a href="/experiments" class="text-teal-700 underline underline-offset-2">Experiments</a>
				pages, or get in touch using the links below.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
